cmu-swarm-no-core = You need a living hive core to summon your lesser swarm.
cmu-swarm-cooldown = The hive is still recovering from the last lesser swarm summon.

ent-CMUActionSummonSwarm = Summon lesser swarm
    .desc = Spawn fifteen AI lessers at the hive core. Survivors accumulate. Usable every six minutes.
ent-CMUActionGuardSwarm = Swarm guard marker
    .desc = Order your lessers to move to a marker, spread out, and defend it. They return after fighting nearby enemies.
ent-CMUActionFollowSwarm = Swarm escort
    .desc = Order your lessers to escort a living player-controlled xeno in your hive, including yourself, and attack nearby enemies.
ent-CMUSwarmLesser = lesser swarm drone
    .desc = A small, expendable drone directed by its queen.
ent-CMUSwarmGuardMarker = swarm guard marker
    .desc = The queen has ordered her lesser swarm to defend this position.
